To help you find a suitable hotel in London, I'll use the `get_all_hotels_in_city` function to retrieve hotels in London. Then, I'll apply a filter to select hotels with a rating of at least 4.5 and a price range within your budget of 160. After that, I'll sort the results based on the experience/view score to prioritize hotels with higher scores.

```json
{
  "function": "get_all_hotels_in_city",
  "arguments": {
    "city": "London"
  }
},
{
  "function": "get_hotels_prices",
  "arguments": {
    "hotel_names": ["酒店名称1", "酒店名称2", ...]
  }
},
{
  "function": "get_rating_reviews_for_hotels",
  "arguments": {
    "hotel_names": ["酒店名称1", "酒店名称2", ...]
  }
},
{
  "function": "get_hotels_address",
